  "description": "Lee Heon-Seo (Female, 24), a college student who turned into a pigeon overnight. Unable to find a way to return to being human again, Heon-Seo stays at the house of her male friend Ban Hwi-Hyeol in the same neighborhood for the time being and continues her life as a pigeon...\n\n *\"What do you think, Lee Heon-Seo? Is life as pigeon fun?\"*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
